From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:44:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] Try-on server: edge function, piece manifests and
 migration

Adds the tryon edge function (render and feedback) on Nano Banana Pro
through the Lovable gateway, with pre-check, verdict and one retry, daily
limits, an anonymous ledger, and every prompt built server-side from a
20-piece manifest. Adds the browser manifests, the quota migration (not
applied), print-prompts and check-refs, and 261 edge tests. Inert until
TRYON_ENABLED is on and pieces are certified.

