+  The server's copy (supabase/functions/tryon/pieces.ts) holds the prompt
+  words and the reference photos; tests/edge/tryon/pieces.test.ts keeps the
+  shared fields (handle, kind, slot, stones, certified) equal in both, and
+  TRY_ON_LIVE_HANDLES in tryOnHandles.ts equal to the certified set here.
+
+  `certified` is the date the owner approved the piece's proof renders. An
+  uncertified piece is never listed on the real shop, and the server refuses
+  it (503 paused, piece_unavailable).
+*/
